models/r1_rover and ardupilot/r1_rover.param are copied from the Gazebo models of ArduPilot/SITL_Models
(https://github.com/ArduPilot/SITL_Models, Gazebo/models/r1_rover and Gazebo/config/r1_rover.param).
ardupilot/skywalker_x8_quad.param and ardupilot/swan_k1_hwing.param are copied from SITL_Models' Gazebo/config. The
skywalker_x8_quad and swan_k1_hwing models themselves (meshes of 12 MB each) are not copied: scripts/build_ardupilot.sh
fetches SITL_Models into SITL_Models/ (untracked) and the launch puts its Gazebo/models on the resource path.
